WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.507
Step 1 of 9. One click on “Try it as a guest” opens a private 24-hour sandbox. No sign-up.

2
00:00:03.507 --> 00:00:07.624
Step 2 of 9. Home: who you are meeting next and who is due a catch-up.

3
00:00:07.624 --> 00:00:11.956
Step 3 of 9. Contacts: 25 sample people. The search covers every field, ported from the 2021 app.

4
00:00:11.956 --> 00:00:16.303
Step 4 of 9. Filter to the people who have their own 4399 CRM account (linked contacts).

5
00:00:16.303 --> 00:00:21.685
Step 5 of 9. Add someone by user name: @demo is the shared demo account, Jordan Lee.

6
00:00:21.685 --> 00:00:26.369
Step 6 of 9. Their own profile is copied in and stays linked, so one tap syncs it later.

7
00:00:26.369 --> 00:00:29.667
Step 7 of 9. Every account has a QR code to show when you meet in person.

8
00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:36.839
Step 8 of 9. Scan someone else's code. The camera here is a simulated feed showing a second sandbox's code.

9
00:00:36.839 --> 00:00:42.000
Step 9 of 9. The scanned person is added and opened: Lena Park, linked to her own account.
